
  ✓ init: 1 done

  Worktrees folder  ../.trees
  Base branch       develop (was main)
  .env from         example
  .env files        apps/api/.env
  On create         pnpm install
  On clean          make down (goes on if it fails)
  Settings file     .git/wtm/config.toml

  → wtm create     create a worktree to get started
  → wtm relocate   move the worktrees made elsewhere into the folder
  → wtm run init   set up what runs in each worktree

